# ==============================================================================
# om's own core routes (program files, mounted at /etc/caddy/core.d).
#
# Generated workspace routes live in $OM_STATE_DIR/routes/ (default
# ~/.local/state/om/routes/), mounted at /etc/caddy/conf.d — do not edit by hand:
#
#   <ws>-<svc>.caddy           http://<ws>.<svc>.localhost, and the service's own ports:
#                              :20000+slot (loopback, VPN) and, if public, :21000+slot (LAN, VPN)
#   <ws>-<svc>.private_alias   /<svc> and alias paths → its private port (private tier)
#   <ws>-<svc>.public_alias    the same → its public port               (public tier)
#
# Written and pruned by `om start` / `om reload` / `om add` / `om edit` / `om remove`.
# Each file's header records its owning workspace; om never touches files it
# doesn't own.
# ==============================================================================
